From af012904abb798311a685e848cc5560ddd8e6c55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pilot <pilot@local>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:45:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] governance: hold concept names as forms per the owner's
 answer [2026-11-13 03:45]

T-028 pilot (stacked on T-026). Migration 127 rebuilds term_aliases to one row per occurrence (form_id = old rowid, unique occurrence index, usage_type), adds the FK search_execution_forms.form_id -> term_aliases(form_id), adds term_label_picks (OD-38 judge/reason/former label) and v_term_names. db.py: _name_holder/_near_terms per language and attestation-aware; add-term writes the first form and gains --first-form; rename-term writes no alias row and gains --from-form/--judge; mint label screen only; add-alias occurrences, refuses DOMAIN, --usage-type. Tests T028-01..07. Callers: three test files, two skills, machines.yaml, stage-map, owner-browser, context-map.
